# External links (Comms + reference tenant)

National union websites reorganize often — **broken cited URLs are usually upstream CMS changes**, not UnionOps regressions. Point stewards at `/assets` mirrors and updated hub URLs in the registry; do not treat report as a toolbox bug by default.

## Single source of truth

- **Product citations:** [`src/lib/constants/comms-sources.ts`](../../src/lib/constants/comms-sources.ts) — `COMMS_SOURCES`, `PAGE_SOURCE_IDS`, `getSourcesForPage()`.
- **Rendered in UI:** [`SourcesBlock`](../../src/components/comms/SourcesBlock.tsx) on guides/tools; full list on `/guide/resources`.
- **Do not** add new hardcoded `https://` national-union or government citation URLs in pages — add/update a `CommsSource` id and reference it (or pass `pageId` to `SourcesBlock`).

**Exception (resolved LINK-001):** Website ZIP OPSEU footer links come from `getOpseuWebsiteFooterSources()` in `comms-sources.ts`.

## Replace vs remove

- **Replace** when the resource moved or the URL changed — update registry first.
- **Remove** only duplicate hrefs outside the registry, or links with no user value after a **replacement** exists (internal `/assets`, updated hub URL, or revised copy).
- **Never remove** a branding authority citation without replacement text — logos also live under `public/assets/caat-opseu/` and `/assets`; external link = official guidelines, not sole download path.

## Audit tiers (see full playbook)

[`docs/audit/external-links-audit-plan.md`](../../docs/audit/external-links-audit-plan.md) — ticket [`LINK-001`](../../docs/audit/execution-backlog.md).

| Tier | Scope |
|------|--------|
| A | `comms-sources`, `SourcesBlock`, hardcoded UI, exported website ZIP |
| B | `seed/reference-tenant-opseu-caat.json` membership URLs |
| C | `docs/SOURCES.md`, workshop, `.cursor/rules/opseu-branding.mdc` |
| D | Exempt: localhost, example.com, demo emails, XML namespaces |

## Verification

- **Browser** is authoritative for `opseu.org` (HEAD/crawlers often get **403** Cloudflare).
- `comms-sources.test.ts` checks URL shape only — not reachability.
- After changing Tier A URLs: sync `docs/SOURCES.md`, `opseu-branding.mdc`, and decision log table in the audit plan doc.

## OPSEU branding URL

Registry id `opseu-branding` → `https://opseu.org/about/` (2026-07-30). Legacy `/12263` deep links must not return. Re-check in browser if national site reorganizes again.

## Multi-union

- National union URLs belong in **`COMMS_SOURCES`** with optional `unionIds` (e.g. `["opseu"]`), not in generic core components.
- **`getSourcesForPage(pageId, unionPresetId)`** / `SourcesBlock` filter by Brand Kit preset. Unset preset → reference tenant (OPSEU-scoped still shown). Other presets hide OPSEU-only rows.
- Website ZIP OPSEU footer: only when `includeOpseuResources` (`unionPresetId === "opseu"`).
- **Do not** bundle other unions’ official logos because OPSEU is mirrored — colours + steward upload + link to their brand page until written permission. Product stance: [`session-knowledge-2026-07-30-multi-union-sources.md`](../../docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-07-30-multi-union-sources.md).
- Other unions: add their own `CommsSource` rows with `unionIds` when product needs them — no logo pack required.
